IN (Computer Science or Mechanical): Arun, Kumar, Sita.
NOT IN course_id 4: Sita, Meena.
ANY (marks > ANY course 2): records with marks greater than at least one course-2 mark (45).
ALL (marks > ALL course 2): records with marks greater than the highest course-2 mark (60).
